@baseUrl = http://localhost:4011

### only products that are on sale
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products?active=true

### price range filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products?minPriceCents=1500&maxPriceCents=5000

### sort by name, ascending
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products?sort=name

### sort by price, descending
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products?sort=-priceCents

### an unknown sort value is rejected
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products?sort=cheapest

### unknown query parameters are rejected, not ignored
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products?tenant=ten_globex

### an impossible range is a validation error
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products?minPriceCents=5000&maxPriceCents=1000

### a valid filter that matches nothing
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products?maxPriceCents=100
